The `fillRecords()` function populates an array of 'Record' pointers concurrently using a mutex for synchronization between threads. You can modify this code to integrate logging and performance monitoring modules as needed. Keep in mind that this is just a starting point, and you should optimize it further according to your specific requirements.']

