To balance between memory usage and performance, the code considers implementing a linked list when the capacity limit is exceeded. This helps reduce frequent allocations and deallocations in high throughput scenarios. Additionally, the code includes logging for debugging purposes and ensures thread safety by using non-blocking data structures.']

